{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Design decision 2026-11-05 (operator): when a rebar ticket names a release the Jira project lacks, the bridge does not write it, keeps it on the rebar ticket, raises a BRIDGE_ALERT naming the missing version, and retries each pass. The bridge never creates Jira versions. Added an acceptance criterion."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793914957835308001,"uuid":"1d1126ad-bb79-419b-85e7-a73e080f70bc"}